#: ../../../PDB/MsfFile.md:13
msgid ""
"Each component is stored as an indexed block, the length of which is "
"specified in `SuperBlock::BlockSize`. The file consists of 1 or more "
"iterations of the following pattern (sometimes referred to as an "
"\"interval\"):"
